  "website": "https://www.pickyourown.org/AME2email.php?ADDT=UPDN&amp;EN=Derrick+Farms&amp;ES=MA&amp;EC=Worcester+County&amp;EP=%28508%29+882-5591&amp;ECT=Oakham&amp;EZ=&amp;EA=301+Sanders+Road&amp;EA2=&amp;EW=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2FDerrickblueberries&amp;RD=NW&amp;EF=Derrickblueberries%2F&amp;EM=No+match.+&amp;EX=US&amp;PG=MAworcester.htm&amp;OP=Call+to+confirm%3B%3B+&amp;IG=&amp;TW=&amp;DS=In+2007%3A+Tuesday+to+Saturday+from+8+am+to+6+pm%2C+Sundays+from+8+am+to+noon%2C+Closed+Mondays.+We+provide+containers%2C+children+are+welcome+with+adult+supervision.+Senior+citizens+and+handicap+accessible+areas+also+available+with+chairs+for+everyone+to+sit+and+pick+in.+Comments+from+a+visitor+on+July+21%2C+2013%3A+%28positive%29+%22We+visited+this+farm+07%2F20%2F2014+and+will+definitely+go+again%21+The+staff+is+fantastic+-+very+friendly+and+helpful.+The+grounds+were+so+pretty+with+a+small+pond+with+a+family+of+geese+and+rows+upon+rows+of+blueberry+bushes+that+were+just+loaded+down+with+berries.+They+provide+you+with+a+bucket+%28holds+about+11+pounds+of+berries+when+filled+to+the+top%29+and+a+chair+to+sit+it+while+you+pick+the+berries.+The+cost+was+%242.50+per+pound.+They+have+bathroom+facilities+on+site+and+also+provide+cold+water.%22Comments+from+a+visitor+on+August+16%2C+2011%3A+%28positive%29+%22I+went+blueberry+picking+for+the+first+time+at+Derrick+Farms.+I+was+totally+satisfied+with+the+whole+place.+I+especially+liked+...&amp;DR=Route+122+to+Route+148%2C+South+3+one+half+miles%2C+from+Spencer+take+Route+31+North+2+miles+past+St.+Joseph%5C%5C%5C%27s+Monastery+and+follow+signs+to+farm+in+Oakham.+",
